WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.960
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:11.230 --> 00:14.460
[Ryu Seil]

3
00:18.880 --> 00:22.340
[Ha Junghoon]

4
00:26.410 --> 00:29.660
[Lee Jungchan]

5
00:33.480 --> 00:36.980
[Jeong Siwan]

6
00:42.340 --> 00:47.020
[Boy, with Caution]

7
00:49.130 --> 00:52.030
[But you don't know what affection is?]

8
00:51.820 --> 00:54.090
Whatever it was, it must have been pretty boring,

9
00:52.160 --> 00:56.690
[I don't know what I gave my wife—whether it was affection or love. Whatever it was, it must have been pretty boring, since that's the kind of person I am.]

10
00:54.500 --> 00:56.500
since that's the kind of person I am.

11
00:58.820 --> 01:00.280
That's not true.

12
01:02.740 --> 01:04.010
Mr. Jang.

13
01:13.160 --> 01:15.890
I won't get the wrong idea about a boring person.

14
01:21.170 --> 01:22.789
So,

15
01:22.250 --> 01:36.370
[Boy, with Caution] [Episode 4]

16
01:25.190 --> 01:27.220
can I keep getting the wrong idea?

17
01:32.990 --> 01:35.750
Regret, why do you think you're boring?

18
01:49.460 --> 01:51.289
[Jeong Subin]

19
01:54.830 --> 01:57.600
Is there really something going on between you and Subin?

20
01:57.600 --> 01:59.670
Jiyoung, let's talk.

21
02:00.130 --> 02:01.590
Hold up. Let's talk.

22
02:02.320 --> 02:04.110
You know it's not true. Why are you misunderstanding me too?

23
02:04.110 --> 02:07.030
If it's not true, why are you going around interviewing for contract teaching jobs?

24
02:07.030 --> 02:09.190
Didn't you say you were going to take the teacher certification exam?

25
02:09.190 --> 02:11.009
You're way past the age to be a contract worker everywhere.

26
02:11.009 --> 02:15.180
That's because... I'm not ready.

27
02:15.650 --> 02:18.190
She dropped out on her own. You knew that?

28
02:18.510 --> 02:20.460
She just didn't want to cause that kind of rumor.

29
02:20.460 --> 02:21.560
She thought it was embarrassing.

30
02:21.560 --> 02:24.020
So she chose not to continue school herself.

31
02:24.390 --> 02:26.320
This kind of thing is nothing at all.

32
02:26.320 --> 02:28.460
But to me, it's a big deal.

33
02:30.640 --> 02:32.579
I know very well

34
02:32.770 --> 02:34.280
what exactly happened.

35
02:38.070 --> 02:39.230
Fine.

36
02:40.040 --> 02:42.710
Since it's so important to you, it must be.

37
02:43.370 --> 02:44.770
But Kiwoo,

38
02:46.950 --> 02:48.970
you're so boring.

39
02:51.630 --> 02:53.810
It's driving me crazy.

40
02:54.610 --> 02:55.870
You know?

41
02:57.579 --> 02:59.780
I'm going to stay at my mom's for a while.

42
03:08.180 --> 03:10.180
Mr. Jang, you are very special to me.

43
03:23.400 --> 03:25.280
How could you come over so suddenly?

44
03:25.280 --> 03:26.280
Oh.

45
03:26.420 --> 03:29.060
I made some water kimchi, but I made too much.

46
03:29.200 --> 03:30.490
Oh, I'm exhausted.

47
03:30.670 --> 03:33.370
I called Jiyoung, but she didn't answer.

48
03:34.420 --> 03:35.420
What are you still standing there for?

49
03:35.420 --> 03:37.680
Go wash up, and come eat when you're done.

50
03:52.260 --> 03:53.520
You're going to drink?

51
03:53.720 --> 03:55.320
Snacks to go with the drinks.

52
03:55.470 --> 03:56.740
Do you want a glass too?

53
03:57.720 --> 03:58.850
No, thanks.

54
04:04.900 --> 04:06.030
Where's Jiyoung?

55
04:07.540 --> 04:08.940
She went to work.

56
04:09.710 --> 04:11.240
But it's the weekend today.

57
04:11.920 --> 04:14.160
Did you just come to see if she was home?

58
04:15.820 --> 04:18.680
I was just curious if she was avoiding me on purpose.

59
04:18.750 --> 04:19.950
Are you guys...

60
04:21.190 --> 04:22.590
breaking up?

61
04:25.270 --> 04:26.630
You're not, right?

62
04:32.030 --> 04:33.550
It's not like that.

63
04:33.770 --> 04:37.300
She went on a business trip abroad. I didn't tell you in advance.

64
04:37.560 --> 04:39.350
Son, give me the bowl.

65
05:00.070 --> 05:01.720
Don't break up.

66
05:02.200 --> 05:03.900
I'm begging you.

67
05:06.000 --> 05:09.390
In the eyes of others,

68
05:09.530 --> 05:11.250
that is a flaw.

69
05:18.660 --> 05:21.210
I don't want to be so boring either.

70
05:33.560 --> 05:35.880
But I don't know what to do.

71
05:36.870 --> 05:39.340
[The Teacher Certification Exam You Will Eventually Pass] [Theory Collection for the Teacher Certification Exam] [Korean History for Teachers]

72
05:42.500 --> 05:45.040
[2027 High School Teacher Recruitment Exam Schedule]

73
05:47.300 --> 05:48.900
I have no confidence either.

74
05:59.250 --> 06:02.180
Trying hard to be a flawless person...

75
06:28.580 --> 06:31.760
So I didn't know how to react—

76
06:34.700 --> 06:36.280
to that word "special."

77
06:36.090 --> 06:39.520
[Trying hard to be a flawless person... So I didn't know how to react—to that word "special."]

78
06:57.070 --> 06:58.950
How did you feel at that time?

79
06:59.640 --> 07:01.900
I think that's the most important thing.

80
07:06.160 --> 07:07.170
Choi Youngmoon.

81
07:07.340 --> 07:08.320
Gold Award.

82
07:08.800 --> 07:13.740
This student won the Gold Award in the 2026 school math competition.

83
07:13.870 --> 07:15.930
This certificate is hereby awarded.

84
07:17.450 --> 07:18.500
So cool!

85
07:21.450 --> 07:22.490
Park Sungwon.

86
07:22.650 --> 07:23.810
Silver Award.

87
07:23.860 --> 07:25.520
The rest is the same as before.

88
07:39.740 --> 07:40.750
Class dismissed.

89
07:55.510 --> 07:56.450
Hyunjae.

90
07:59.210 --> 08:03.010
It's time to talk about your college application. Come to my office.

91
08:07.410 --> 08:08.800
[Nakwon High School College Application Form]

92
08:07.500 --> 08:08.950
Target university: none.

93
08:08.950 --> 08:09.930
Major: none.

94
08:10.080 --> 08:12.760
Reason: because it's over after graduation.

95
08:18.070 --> 08:19.670
Is it over after graduation?

96
08:23.080 --> 08:24.570
-Yes. -What is over?

97
08:25.370 --> 08:27.100
Are you going to kill yourself?

98
08:28.550 --> 08:30.150
Is this your way?

99
08:32.330 --> 08:35.190
Do you want me to keep giving you special treatment?

100
08:39.010 --> 08:40.669
Are you not going to answer me?

101
08:44.049 --> 08:47.050
You're not saying this expecting me to answer, right?

102
08:51.470 --> 08:53.600
I see you've been deliberately

103
08:53.740 --> 08:55.870
saying things to upset me.

104
08:57.200 --> 09:00.130
If you're doing this because of what I said last time,

105
09:01.960 --> 09:03.600
I'm sorry.

106
09:04.660 --> 09:06.180
I misspoke.

107
09:11.410 --> 09:13.240
I'm not a special person.

108
09:17.150 --> 09:18.390
So,

109
09:19.790 --> 09:21.850
don't just assume that on your own.

110
09:23.640 --> 09:25.400
That's my own thought.

111
09:29.620 --> 09:30.730
You can go.

112
09:48.670 --> 09:52.220
[You just need to accept it.]

113
09:49.990 --> 09:51.970
You just have to accept it.

114
09:53.610 --> 09:56.420
Maybe you are special to someone.

115
09:58.620 --> 09:59.530
Hyunjae.

116
10:02.060 --> 10:05.020
Whose idea was it for you to get that advanced psychological counseling?

117
10:05.020 --> 10:06.370
Is there a problem?

118
10:08.310 --> 10:09.260
There isn't any.

119
10:09.430 --> 10:10.630
You're sure, right?

120
10:14.550 --> 10:18.150
If you're going to the chairman's office, go downstairs with me.

121
10:20.540 --> 10:23.170
Aren't you going to see your mom?

122
10:30.990 --> 10:32.540
Go change your clothes and come out.

123
10:32.540 --> 10:33.960
I'll wait.

124
10:34.090 --> 10:37.290
You should at least explain it to me first, shouldn't you?

125
10:37.670 --> 10:39.430
Why are we suddenly going to see my mom?

126
10:39.430 --> 10:42.410
The chairman has to go to the hospital for something.

127
10:44.080 --> 10:46.440
Is it personal or business?

128
10:47.990 --> 10:49.400
It should suit you well.

129
10:50.410 --> 10:51.700
I'm not going.

130
10:53.780 --> 10:55.410
We have to be there by 2 PM.

131
10:55.590 --> 10:56.530
Please hurry up.

132
10:56.660 --> 10:57.980
I said I'm not going.

133
10:58.110 --> 11:01.640
Do you plan to see your mom at the hospital after graduation too?

134
11:02.040 --> 11:03.970
Did you say the same thing to my mom?

135
11:04.000 --> 11:04.910
No.

136
11:08.590 --> 11:11.040
After all, you're not very cooperative.

137
11:12.390 --> 11:14.250
Change and come out in 10 minutes.

138
11:16.570 --> 11:18.300
How long do I have to cooperate?

139
11:21.560 --> 11:23.000
With this crap.

140
11:24.670 --> 11:25.930
That's why,

141
11:27.920 --> 11:31.230
you'd better keep a low profile and pretend you don't exist.

142
11:31.230 --> 11:33.290
Just like we agreed at the beginning.

143
11:35.980 --> 11:39.110
You can't transfer to another hospital without paying.

144
11:40.140 --> 11:43.040
Please insert your bank card into the slot.

145
11:43.170 --> 11:45.490
Please select the type of transaction.

146
11:46.260 --> 11:49.100
Please select the type of transaction.

147
11:47.880 --> 11:50.420
[Credit Card Loan (Cash Advance)]

148
11:49.340 --> 11:51.960
Please select the amount you want to withdraw.

149
11:56.180 --> 11:56.960
[Processing, please wait.]

150
11:56.960 --> 11:58.880
[Transaction has been declined.]

151
12:02.160 --> 12:03.620
Hey, it looks boring.

152
12:03.780 --> 12:04.940
What a hassle.

153
12:04.970 --> 12:06.640
-Really? -It really is a hassle.

154
12:06.640 --> 12:08.170
Where is the final payment?

155
12:08.910 --> 12:09.780
You're here.

156
12:10.030 --> 12:12.890
I thought you were too embarrassed about being beaten by Hyunjae

157
12:12.890 --> 12:14.300
to come to school.

158
12:14.990 --> 12:16.550
Give me the final payment.

159
12:16.960 --> 12:18.050
I did the work.

160
12:20.960 --> 12:23.370
Hey, is your hand ruined? By Lee Hyunjae?

161
12:24.420 --> 12:28.080
I'm afraid you won't be able to do the vending machine job anymore.

162
12:30.040 --> 12:32.870
Hey, well, you have Jitae's business card, right?

163
12:35.680 --> 12:38.140
If you can't raise the money, just borrow it.

164
12:38.200 --> 12:40.060
Why frown?

165
12:43.630 --> 12:45.390
[Daily Interest Loan Service]

166
12:49.740 --> 12:51.520
Well, I'll contact him.

167
12:51.650 --> 12:52.690
You go take a look.

168
12:53.130 --> 12:55.510
That guy likes

169
12:55.640 --> 12:56.740
people like you.

170
13:24.260 --> 13:26.660
Hyunjong, are you unhappy with something?

171
13:27.340 --> 13:29.030
I even made time for you to do cardio.

172
13:29.030 --> 13:30.380
Why that expression?

173
13:31.870 --> 13:33.480
I'll try again.

174
13:37.570 --> 13:40.660
Just try messing it up again next time.

175
13:43.260 --> 13:45.150
I'll have your parents come.

176
13:45.510 --> 13:46.670
Hear me?

177
13:47.620 --> 13:48.890
Know that.

178
13:50.850 --> 13:52.230
Why aren't you answering me?

179
13:52.230 --> 13:56.160
I know. I understand.

180
13:57.130 --> 13:58.070
Really.

181
13:58.190 --> 14:00.850
You have ears, so naturally you can understand.

182
14:02.170 --> 14:04.360
You know I used to be an athlete, right?

183
14:04.990 --> 14:08.700
I can't stand slow losers like you the most.

184
14:10.280 --> 14:11.590
So be careful.

185
14:12.000 --> 14:13.170
Yes.

186
14:13.970 --> 14:15.400
I'm very sorry.

187
14:25.470 --> 14:27.070
Are you here to borrow money?

188
14:30.090 --> 14:32.360
Ah, you're the vending machine,

189
14:32.660 --> 14:34.320
Choi Youngmoon's underling.

190
14:37.710 --> 14:40.410
Where did he buy that drug?

191
14:40.700 --> 14:42.320
Can you tell me?

192
14:48.440 --> 14:51.970
You're late because you were borrowing money everywhere, huh?

193
14:52.440 --> 14:56.700
Speaking of, you should be picky about who you work for. Choi Youngmoon is...

194
14:57.730 --> 15:01.430
You don't care about being cool?

195
15:03.390 --> 15:04.860
Just kidding.

196
15:06.440 --> 15:08.390
You're here to borrow money, what need do you have for being cool,

197
15:08.390 --> 15:09.400
right?

198
15:18.070 --> 15:19.560
I don't smoke.

199
15:20.910 --> 15:21.930
Why?

200
15:22.230 --> 15:23.390
I'm an athlete.

201
15:23.580 --> 15:26.180
I haven't seen many athletes with real skills.

202
15:32.110 --> 15:35.710
I don't think you can make money from sports anymore. Just smoke.

203
15:57.090 --> 15:58.130
So,

204
15:58.810 --> 16:00.030
how much do you need?

205
16:00.280 --> 16:01.120
10 million won.

206
16:01.120 --> 16:02.520
You blurted it right out.

207
16:08.200 --> 16:09.530
What about collateral?

208
16:19.030 --> 16:21.960
If you don't have anything good to use as collateral,

209
16:22.530 --> 16:24.110
just use yourself.

210
16:28.370 --> 16:30.300
Did something happen to you today?

211
16:31.100 --> 16:35.780
[Did something happen to you today? Why are you so quiet?]

212
16:31.530 --> 16:33.060
Why are you so quiet?

213
16:45.910 --> 16:49.600
[Lee Hyunjae]

214
16:53.950 --> 16:55.110
Hello?

215
16:58.490 --> 16:59.740
Hello?

216
17:03.050 --> 17:04.280
Lee Hyunjae.

217
17:05.079 --> 17:06.089
Yeah.

218
17:07.000 --> 17:08.859
You're the one who called, speak.

219
17:09.020 --> 17:10.170
Mr. Jang.

220
17:12.150 --> 17:14.230
I was doing pretty well.

221
17:16.560 --> 17:18.660
Living as if I didn't care about anything.

222
17:18.589 --> 17:27.530
[Mr. Jang Kiwoo]

223
17:20.780 --> 17:22.910
But I can't live like this anymore.

224
17:25.319 --> 17:27.579
I want to say I can't do it.

225
17:31.450 --> 17:32.910
Where are you now?

226
17:35.460 --> 17:37.840
If I tell you, will you come?

227
17:40.180 --> 17:41.760
Will you come?

228
17:43.190 --> 17:44.670
I'll go over now.

229
17:45.050 --> 17:46.230
Where are you?

230
17:47.660 --> 17:49.020
School.

231
17:51.710 --> 17:52.900
What about dinner?

232
17:53.820 --> 17:55.020
Have you eaten?

233
18:12.550 --> 18:13.950
Should I order more?

234
18:14.900 --> 18:16.820
I see you haven't eaten much.

235
18:18.280 --> 18:20.050
I can't eat as much as you.

236
18:22.420 --> 18:24.640
I already ate lunch too.

237
18:25.230 --> 18:26.960
It's just a bit uncomfortable.

238
18:28.410 --> 18:29.580
Looks like it.

239
18:32.730 --> 18:34.790
That you do look a bit uncomfortable.

240
18:41.080 --> 18:42.150
Eat more.

241
18:42.420 --> 18:44.080
Order more if it's not enough.

242
18:55.820 --> 18:58.750
How can you pretend not to have it when you clearly do?

243
19:01.240 --> 19:03.290
That's what I hear the most.

244
19:04.900 --> 19:07.070
Sometimes I think I understand.

245
19:08.360 --> 19:10.320
Other times I don't quite get it.

246
19:11.980 --> 19:13.650
Then don't understand.

247
19:22.750 --> 19:25.680
Growing up, I deliberately made myself full of flaws

248
19:27.560 --> 19:29.690
just to make myself an embarrassment.

249
19:31.950 --> 19:35.500
I just hoped to be my dad's only stain.

250
19:41.120 --> 19:42.290
Mr. Jang.

251
19:44.530 --> 19:45.970
Today,

252
19:46.980 --> 19:49.350
I can't go to your place, can I?

253
19:54.270 --> 19:56.670
Why are you asking when you know the answer?

254
20:01.140 --> 20:03.670
I just pretended not to know and tried asking.

255
20:05.160 --> 20:06.360
A can of cola, please.

256
20:06.480 --> 20:08.050
Okay, coming right up.

257
20:13.820 --> 20:17.480
Do you have a friend who can lie to your family and let you stay over?

258
20:21.560 --> 20:24.220
I have to consider the chairman's position too.

259
20:30.190 --> 20:31.300
Yeah.

260
20:31.670 --> 20:33.520
It's because of your dad, right?

261
20:45.120 --> 20:46.500
Just for today.

262
20:56.290 --> 20:57.530
You're back.

263
20:57.750 --> 20:59.180
I heard you met your mom.

264
20:59.300 --> 21:01.760
Didn't I tell you to ask me if you needed me...

265
21:05.490 --> 21:06.820
A guest?

266
21:12.210 --> 21:13.960
Is it your student?

267
21:18.060 --> 21:19.960
Are you out of your mind?

268
21:20.090 --> 21:22.430
I told you I was coming over today.

269
21:23.340 --> 21:25.010
You don't even remember, do you?

270
21:25.010 --> 21:28.520
Not again. He's from Nakwon High School, right?

271
21:28.820 --> 21:31.500
Why do you bring people home?

272
21:31.950 --> 21:34.550
Do you think you're some kind of youth shelter?

273
21:34.730 --> 21:36.330
I have my reasons.

274
21:36.480 --> 21:39.010
You always have a reason.

275
21:53.790 --> 21:58.100
Didn't I tell you to call me if you were going to see your mom?

276
21:58.250 --> 22:01.610
Your mom even called to ask if we broke up.

277
22:01.880 --> 22:03.800
Guess how I answered her.

278
22:05.520 --> 22:06.980
She knows.

279
22:08.300 --> 22:09.170
What?

280
22:09.360 --> 22:11.000
She's always known—

281
22:11.340 --> 22:13.750
just waiting for me to speak up.

282
22:15.120 --> 22:17.020
As usual.

283
22:17.550 --> 22:19.270
Just avoiding the topic.

284
22:23.920 --> 22:26.070
Aren't you the one avoiding it?

285
22:29.100 --> 22:30.900
Besides, Kiwoo.

286
22:31.920 --> 22:35.720
Protect what you want to protect, and don't mess with what you don't.

287
22:35.890 --> 22:37.950
Whether it's your mom, me,

288
22:38.090 --> 22:39.690
or your student.

289
22:49.560 --> 22:51.180
Get my bag for me.

290
22:51.300 --> 22:53.700
I didn't even grab it seeing you had a guest.

291
22:55.330 --> 22:56.610
Hello?

292
22:57.620 --> 22:59.220
Hello, producer.

293
23:00.740 --> 23:02.110
Now?

294
23:05.410 --> 23:08.300
Ah, it might be difficult right now.

295
23:08.560 --> 23:09.720
About...

296
23:11.860 --> 23:14.520
40 minutes later is okay.

297
23:31.110 --> 23:32.360
Mr. Jang.

298
23:35.030 --> 23:37.330
Have you had students like me before?

299
23:45.810 --> 23:47.490
Special treatment—

300
23:49.420 --> 23:51.290
is it the same for everyone?

301
23:55.400 --> 23:57.200
How much did you hear?

302
24:04.980 --> 24:06.480
I'll be right back.

303
24:17.530 --> 24:18.870
How many preceded me,

304
24:19.040 --> 24:20.500
Mr. Jang?

305
24:22.930 --> 24:23.760
Let go.

306
24:23.930 --> 24:25.010
Why...

307
24:25.780 --> 24:27.250
aren't you answering me?

308
24:41.300 --> 24:43.180
Why ask that?

309
24:49.550 --> 24:51.610
Do you treat them like you treat me?

310
24:53.400 --> 24:55.370
Apply medicine when they're hurt.

311
24:56.490 --> 24:58.820
Let them stay when they have nowhere to go.

312
25:31.440 --> 25:32.920
I...

313
25:36.460 --> 25:39.480
hope you only have me.

314
25:44.580 --> 25:45.890
Just like me.

315
26:15.850 --> 26:21.250
[Boy, with Caution]

316
26:21.780 --> 26:23.170
Did I do something wrong?

317
26:23.170 --> 26:24.730
I don't understand.

318
26:24.950 --> 26:26.630
How can affection be wrong?

319
26:26.850 --> 26:28.000
Did you do it on purpose?

320
